# Animals the GM can spawn with /ANIMAL. TAB separated: datablock | label_en | label_de.  Add a line to add an animal; run tools/kz_sync.py.
# Order = order in the list. Datablock names come from the game's animal datablocks (ChieftainData ... are the Daniel / Jorvik additions).
BoarData	Boar	Wildschwein
WolfData	Wolf	Wolf
BearData	Bear	Baer
MooseData	Moose	Elch
DeerMaleData	Deer (male)	Hirsch
HindData	Hind	Hirschkuh
HareData	Hare	Hase
GrouseData	Grouse	Auerhuhn
AurochsBullData	Aurochs bull	Auerochse (Bulle)
AurochsCowData	Aurochs cow	Auerochse (Kuh)
SowData	Sow	Sau
MuttonData	Sheep	Schaf
WildHorseData	Wild horse	Wildpferd
ChieftainData	Chieftain	Haeuptling
WitchData	Witch	Hexe
HunterData	Hunter	Jaeger
